  "account": "文汇书香苑",
  "source_title": "梅贻琦 堂堂校长摆地摊，女儿差 2 分他却死活不肯走后门 #梅贻琦 #南渡北归 #读书感悟\n#读书心得#读书笔记#读书推荐 #文字共鸣\n#情感共鸣",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_0225e71719275a3e_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 337.241379,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你敢信吗？一个堂堂清华大学的校长住院的时候，连药都吃不起，去世之后，连入土的钱都没有。最后是学生们，你一块我一块凑的钱，才让他入土为安。这个人叫梅玉奇，清华历史上任期最长的校长干了整整十七年。先说一件事，这一天本该他上课铃都响了，人还没到。学生们正纳闷呢，教士们猛的推开梅，一齐气喘吁吁，跑进来，满头大汗。长袍上还沾着灰。他一边擦汗，一边笑说，对不住各位，我刚才在街上替我内人看糕点摊呢，他去进货了，七点半还没回来，我有课，只好把摊子一丢就跑来了。不过今天生意不错，点心卖的特别好。说完他自己还笑底下的学生呢，一个个眼泪止不住的往下掉。一个名牌大学的校长放了学不回家，歇着跟夫人一块儿站大街上摆摊卖点心。他夫人叫韩永华，做的这种米糕，有个名字叫定胜糕，取的是抗战一定胜利的意思。为了不让人认出自己是校长，夫人，他特意穿上佣人才穿的蓝布褂子，挎着篮子步行一个多钟头，跑到老远的冠生园食品店去寄卖，舍不得穿袜子，光着脚穿皮鞋，脚磨破了肿的老高。咬着牙还去有人问他，你图什么？他说，孩子们要读书，家里要吃饭，校长那点薪水不够用，不够用到什么程度？我给你说几个细节，他儿子在昆明跑警报就是躲空袭，把眼镜跑丢了，居然没钱再配一副一个校长的儿子，连副眼镜都配不起。有学生亲眼看见梅一齐，有时候拿包衣服去典当行换钱应急。一九四一年，他去成都出差回来的飞机票都买好了。听说能搭邮政汽车，虽然要多走一天，路上还可能遭遇空袭，但能给学校省二百多块钱。他二话不说，把飞机票退了改坐油车，一路颠簸，灰头土脸的赶回来，开会，迟到了二十分钟，进门。第一句话就是，对不起，我来晚了，他当校长，把自己该享受的待遇全砍了。校长免费用的电话，免费供应的米面，冬天免费拉的燃煤通通取消，省下来的钱干什么？全贴给教授了，他说要留住好老师，不能光靠情怀。可就是这么一个穷的叮当响的人，手里管着的钱，说出来能吓你一跳。清华有一笔耕子赔款，基金数目巨大，多少大人物都惦记着这笔钱从梅一其手上过了十几年，他到哪都带着一个旧皮包形影不离睡觉，放床头住院，放床底下，谁也不让碰。所有人都猜这里面肯定装着什么贵重东西，要么是银票，要么是贵重财物，至少也得是重要文件吧。你再看他办事的原则，就知道这个人有多硬。当年云南省主席龙云在云南说一不二，西南联大在昆明办学，人家龙云要钱，给钱要力，出力，是联大的大恩人。可龙云的女儿考联大附中落榜了，龙云脸上挂不住，派秘书长去找梅伊齐书童秘书长去了半天，回来跟龙云说，主席，我打听了梅校长自己的女儿。梅祖芬考清华也差了两分，没录取，人家亲闺女都没走后门，龙云听完半天没说出话来，从此再也不提这事儿了。梅祖峰回家哭说，爸，我就差两分，你就不能说句话吗？嗯，有没一起看着女儿沉默了很久，一个字都没说，那是他亲闺女啊，一句话的事儿，他就是不开这个口。你说这样一个人手里握着千万巨款，自己穷到摆地摊，女儿差两分，不肯通融。他那个从不离身的皮包里到底装着什么？是钱是账还是什么不为人知的秘密？这个答案我留到下集告诉你，但我可以先透一句。一九六二年，梅一琦在台北病逝后，这个皮包在众人面前被打开。在场的人没有一个不掉眼泪的关注。我下集，咱们接着讲，觉得没校长有骨气的点赞、收藏、评论区说说你的看法，再转发给身边的人，看看什么叫真正的读书人。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 930,
      "text": "你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2010,
      "end_ms": 5510,
      "text": "一个堂堂清华大学的校长住院的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5510,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "连药都吃不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7410,
      "end_ms": 8310,
      "text": "去世之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8310,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "连入土的钱都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10170,
      "end_ms": 11550,
      "text": "最后是学生们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11550,
      "end_ms": 13090,
      "text": "你一块我一块凑的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13590,
      "end_ms": 15410,
      "text": "才让他入土为安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16370,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "这个人叫梅玉奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18550,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "清华历史上任期最长的校长干了整整十七年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25130,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "先说一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27210,
      "end_ms": 31980,
      "text": "这一天本该他上课铃都响了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32340,
      "end_ms": 33180,
      "text": "人还没到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34300,
      "end_ms": 35700,
      "text": "学生们正纳闷呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35860,
      "end_ms": 38020,
      "text": "教士们猛的推开梅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38020,
      "end_ms": 39400,
      "text": "一齐气喘吁吁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39480,
      "end_ms": 40120,
      "text": "跑进来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40440,
      "end_ms": 41500,
      "text": "满头大汗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41660,
      "end_ms": 43060,
      "text": "长袍上还沾着灰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43540,
      "end_ms": 44620,
      "text": "他一边擦汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44660,
      "end_ms": 45780,
      "text": "一边笑说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45780,
      "end_ms": 46600,
      "text": "对不住各位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46920,
      "end_ms": 50440,
      "text": "我刚才在街上替我内人看糕点摊呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51200,
      "end_ms": 52300,
      "text": "他去进货了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 52480,
      "end_ms": 53860,
      "text": "七点半还没回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54220,
      "end_ms": 54880,
      "text": "我有课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 55120,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "只好把摊子一丢就跑来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58060,
      "end_ms": 59500,
      "text": "不过今天生意不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 59600,
      "end_ms": 61065,
      "text": "点心卖的特别好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 61720,
      "end_ms": 64820,
      "text": "说完他自己还笑底下的学生呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 64920,
      "end_ms": 67300,
      "text": "一个个眼泪止不住的往下掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 67800,
      "end_ms": 70920,
      "text": "一个名牌大学的校长放了学不回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 70920,
      "end_ms": 75130,
      "text": "歇着跟夫人一块儿站大街上摆摊卖点心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75330,
      "end_ms": 77055,
      "text": "他夫人叫韩永华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77830,
      "end_ms": 78910,
      "text": "做的这种米糕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 79050,
      "end_ms": 81475,
      "text": "有个名字叫定胜糕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 82170,
      "end_ms": 85115,
      "text": "取的是抗战一定胜利的意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 85950,
      "end_ms": 88270,
      "text": "为了不让人认出自己是校长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88330,
      "end_ms": 88805,
      "text": "夫人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 89370,
      "end_ms": 92710,
      "text": "他特意穿上佣人才穿的蓝布褂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 93070,
      "end_ms": 95265,
      "text": "挎着篮子步行一个多钟头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 95690,
      "end_ms": 98655,
      "text": "跑到老远的冠生园食品店去寄卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 99280,
      "end_ms": 100515,
      "text": "舍不得穿袜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 100810,
      "end_ms": 102195,
      "text": "光着脚穿皮鞋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 102570,
      "end_ms": 104365,
      "text": "脚磨破了肿的老高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 104720,
      "end_ms": 106880,
      "text": "咬着牙还去有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 106880,
      "end_ms": 107755,
      "text": "你图什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 108690,
      "end_ms": 109265,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 110090,
      "end_ms": 111215,
      "text": "孩子们要读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 112040,
      "end_ms": 112900,
      "text": "家里要吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 112980,
      "end_ms": 114600,
      "text": "校长那点薪水不够用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 114820,
      "end_ms": 116165,
      "text": "不够用到什么程度？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 116540,
      "end_ms": 117895,
      "text": "我给你说几个细节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 118390,
      "end_ms": 122040,
      "text": "他儿子在昆明跑警报就是躲空袭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 122460,
      "end_ms": 123705,
      "text": "把眼镜跑丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 123910,
      "end_ms": 127440,
      "text": "居然没钱再配一副一个校长的儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 127740,
      "end_ms": 129495,
      "text": "连副眼镜都配不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 129880,
      "end_ms": 132380,
      "text": "有学生亲眼看见梅一齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 132400,
      "end_ms": 135435,
      "text": "有时候拿包衣服去典当行换钱应急。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 136160,
      "end_ms": 137060,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 137060,
      "end_ms": 140405,
      "text": "他去成都出差回来的飞机票都买好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 140790,
      "end_ms": 142665,
      "text": "听说能搭邮政汽车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 143330,
      "end_ms": 144710,
      "text": "虽然要多走一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 144790,
      "end_ms": 146705,
      "text": "路上还可能遭遇空袭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 147240,
      "end_ms": 149265,
      "text": "但能给学校省二百多块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 149910,
      "end_ms": 150710,
      "text": "他二话不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 150710,
      "end_ms": 152950,
      "text": "把飞机票退了改坐油车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 153230,
      "end_ms": 154130,
      "text": "一路颠簸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 154170,
      "end_ms": 155825,
      "text": "灰头土脸的赶回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 156300,
      "end_ms": 156720,
      "text": "开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 156800,
      "end_ms": 158125,
      "text": "迟到了二十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 158750,
      "end_ms": 159130,
      "text": "进门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 159130,
      "end_ms": 160270,
      "text": "第一句话就是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 160270,
      "end_ms": 160815,
      "text": "对不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 161430,
      "end_ms": 162265,
      "text": "我来晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 162530,
      "end_ms": 163355,
      "text": "他当校长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 163780,
      "end_ms": 166225,
      "text": "把自己该享受的待遇全砍了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 166760,
      "end_ms": 168735,
      "text": "校长免费用的电话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 169090,
      "end_ms": 170705,
      "text": "免费供应的米面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 171280,
      "end_ms": 174420,
      "text": "冬天免费拉的燃煤通通取消，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 174840,
      "end_ms": 176540,
      "text": "省下来的钱干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 176780,
      "end_ms": 178100,
      "text": "全贴给教授了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 178100,
      "end_ms": 180375,
      "text": "他说要留住好老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 180730,
      "end_ms": 182325,
      "text": "不能光靠情怀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 183070,
      "end_ms": 185585,
      "text": "可就是这么一个穷的叮当响的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 185970,
      "end_ms": 187070,
      "text": "手里管着的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 187290,
      "end_ms": 188715,
      "text": "说出来能吓你一跳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 189590,
      "end_ms": 191130,
      "text": "清华有一笔耕子赔款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 191130,
      "end_ms": 192975,
      "text": "基金数目巨大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 193840,
      "end_ms": 200235,
      "text": "多少大人物都惦记着这笔钱从梅一其手上过了十几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 201080,
      "end_ms": 206580,
      "text": "他到哪都带着一个旧皮包形影不离睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 206600,
      "end_ms": 208390,
      "text": "放床头住院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 208610,
      "end_ms": 209630,
      "text": "放床底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 209850,
      "end_ms": 210845,
      "text": "谁也不让碰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 211400,
      "end_ms": 214940,
      "text": "所有人都猜这里面肯定装着什么贵重东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 215000,
      "end_ms": 216055,
      "text": "要么是银票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 216390,
      "end_ms": 217965,
      "text": "要么是贵重财物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 218680,
      "end_ms": 220785,
      "text": "至少也得是重要文件吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 221760,
      "end_ms": 223395,
      "text": "你再看他办事的原则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 224100,
      "end_ms": 225565,
      "text": "就知道这个人有多硬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 226700,
      "end_ms": 230525,
      "text": "当年云南省主席龙云在云南说一不二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 230950,
      "end_ms": 232825,
      "text": "西南联大在昆明办学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 233290,
      "end_ms": 234790,
      "text": "人家龙云要钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 234790,
      "end_ms": 235940,
      "text": "给钱要力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 235940,
      "end_ms": 236405,
      "text": "出力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 236880,
      "end_ms": 238385,
      "text": "是联大的大恩人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 238860,
      "end_ms": 242315,
      "text": "可龙云的女儿考联大附中落榜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 242750,
      "end_ms": 244305,
      "text": "龙云脸上挂不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 244710,
      "end_ms": 248700,
      "text": "派秘书长去找梅伊齐书童秘书长去了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 248980,
      "end_ms": 250095,
      "text": "回来跟龙云说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 250680,
      "end_ms": 251100,
      "text": "主席，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 251160,
      "end_ms": 255460,
      "text": "我打听了梅校长自己的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 255460,
      "end_ms": 259185,
      "text": "梅祖芬考清华也差了两分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 259590,
      "end_ms": 260255,
      "text": "没录取，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 260780,
      "end_ms": 262965,
      "text": "人家亲闺女都没走后门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 265050,
      "end_ms": 267635,
      "text": "龙云听完半天没说出话来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 268010,
      "end_ms": 269555,
      "text": "从此再也不提这事儿了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 271580,
      "end_ms": 273930,
      "text": "梅祖峰回家哭说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 273930,
      "end_ms": 274175,
      "text": "爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 275050,
      "end_ms": 276065,
      "text": "我就差两分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 277120,
      "end_ms": 278635,
      "text": "你就不能说句话吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 278970,
      "end_ms": 279090,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 279090,
      "end_ms": 283475,
      "text": "有没一起看着女儿沉默了很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 285460,
      "end_ms": 286605,
      "text": "一个字都没说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 287080,
      "end_ms": 288420,
      "text": "那是他亲闺女啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 288500,
      "end_ms": 289545,
      "text": "一句话的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 289730,
      "end_ms": 291010,
      "text": "他就是不开这个口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 291270,
      "end_ms": 294480,
      "text": "你说这样一个人手里握着千万巨款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 294600,
      "end_ms": 296085,
      "text": "自己穷到摆地摊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 296470,
      "end_ms": 297590,
      "text": "女儿差两分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 297610,
      "end_ms": 298655,
      "text": "不肯通融。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 299100,
      "end_ms": 302830,
      "text": "他那个从不离身的皮包里到底装着什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 303110,
      "end_ms": 307055,
      "text": "是钱是账还是什么不为人知的秘密？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 307520,
      "end_ms": 309915,
      "text": "这个答案我留到下集告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 310700,
      "end_ms": 312065,
      "text": "但我可以先透一句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 313040,
      "end_ms": 313880,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 313880,
      "end_ms": 315675,
      "text": "梅一琦在台北病逝后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 316110,
      "end_ms": 318775,
      "text": "这个皮包在众人面前被打开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 320040,
      "end_ms": 323920,
      "text": "在场的人没有一个不掉眼泪的关注。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 323920,
      "end_ms": 324925,
      "text": "我下集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 325240,
      "end_ms": 326065,
      "text": "咱们接着讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 326540,
      "end_ms": 331645,
      "text": "觉得没校长有骨气的点赞、收藏、评论区说说你的看法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 332420,
      "end_ms": 334080,
      "text": "再转发给身边的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0225e71719275a3e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 334080,
      "end_ms": 337200,
      "text": "看看什么叫真正的读书人。"
    }
  ],
